			"notes": "Hotfix for 1.1.0.\n\n## 🐛 Fixes\n- **Average run time:** Was far too short because it read the run timer after it had been restarted. It is now timed from the Safari Manager's ticket message to the SAFARI REWARD SUMMARY. Unfinished runs (a new ticket before the summary) and runs without a ticket are left out.\n- **Everything PBs:** `Everything except Macaw done!` and `Everything Done!` no longer show a player name, only the time. Biome PBs still name who finished the biome.\n\n## 📦 Download\n- Minecraft 26.3 → `safari-patron-1.1.1+26.3.jar`\n- Minecraft 26.2 → `safari-patron-1.1.1+26.2.jar`"
		},
