			"notes": "## ♦ Profit Tracker\n- **Session Profit panel:** Shard, Safari Essence and Rainbow Feather profits, total, run count, average run time and profit per hour.\n- **Session clock:** Starts when the Safari Manager takes your ticket, pauses when you're away from the Safari. Every game start begins a fresh session.\n- **Total Profit Tracker:** All-time profit item by item in rarity colors, with total runs and total profit. Shows at the Critter Safari Entrance by default (or everywhere outside the Safari, never inside it).\n- **Scrollable:** Shows 10 items at a time; scroll with your mouse wheel over the panel while an inventory is open.\n- **Over inventories:** Both profit panels stay visible on top of inventories and chests.\n- **Bazaar prices:** Instant Sell or Sell Offer. If prices can't be loaded, the panels warn you instead of showing 0.\n- **Safe data:** Profit data has its own save file and is kept between updates.\n- New commands: `/sp sessionprofit`, `/sp totalprofit` (click to copy) and `/sp resetsession`.\n\n## ⏱ Completion Times\n- Biome announcements now include your time and personal best, e.g. `Forest Done! Completed in 2:31 (PB 2:20 by IGN)`.\n\n## ✦ Last Sparkling\n- When a Sparkling is caught, tells you how many runs and how long ago the previous one was.\n\n## 💧 Clear Water\n- See through the water in the Safari, with adjustable opacity. Safari only.\n\n## 🛠 Changes\n- New default panel layout, so panels no longer overlap on a fresh install.\n- Clear Water and Capsule Helper are now on by default.\n- Miria's Contest: new default messages `Ticket earned.` and `New Miria's Contest started.` (`r`, `!dt contest` and Custom are still there). Incomplete warning at 5 minutes by default.\n- Main menu cards: descriptions are no longer cut off.\n\n## ℹ️ Updating from 1.0.2\nYour settings and panel positions are kept. The new defaults above only apply to fresh installs. To get the new panel layout, use **`/sp` → Panels → Reset all panels**.\n\n## 📦 Download\n- Minecraft 26.3 → `safari-patron-1.1.0+26.3.jar`\n- Minecraft 26.2 → `safari-patron-1.1.0+26.2.jar`\n\nRequires Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin.\n\nThanks to @z1rr31 for helping with the profit tracker!"
		},
