			"notes": "### What's new\n- **Miria's Contest:** time left, bracket, score and ticket panel; party messages when your ticket is earned and when a new contest starts; incomplete warnings at 5, 3 and 1 minute\n- **Sparklings HUD:** which sparklings you have caught in your current biome, with an option to list only the missing ones\n- **Total Sparklings HUD:** all 37 sparklings in four columns, shown in the middle area between the biomes\n- **Critterdex Sync:** opening the Sparkling Critterdex in game updates your sparklings list automatically\n- **Update Checker:** tells you in chat when a new version is out; switch on the main menu\n- **Settings:** dropdown choices and custom text fields\n\n### Changes\n- Ticket message choices are now `r` or your own custom text\n- License changed to **Apache-2.0** (with a NOTICE file). Versions up to 1.0.1 stay under the MIT License.\n\n### Notes\n- Contest timing follows your computer clock (contests start at :15, :35 and :55), so keep it accurate.\n- Your sparklings list starts empty; open the Sparkling Critterdex once to fill it.\n- From this version on, the mod tells you in game when an update is available.\n\n### Downloads\n| Minecraft | File |\n|---|---|\n| 26.3 | `safari-patron-1.0.2+26.3.jar` |\n| 26.2 | `safari-patron-1.0.2+26.2.jar` |\n\nRequires Fabric Loader 0.19.5+, Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin. Mod Menu is optional."
